  "result": "`exp` in JWT = seconds since epoch. `Date.now()` = milliseconds. Off by 1000x.\n\n**Wrong:**\n```js\nif (Date.now() > payload.exp) // Date.now() is ~1.7T, exp is ~1.7B \u2014 never expires\n```\n\n**Fix:**\n```js\nif (Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) > payload.exp) {\n  return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Token expired' });\n}\n```\n\nOr use `Date.now() > payload.exp * 1000`.",
